  unitName: Master Lorand
  unitId: 10164
  unitNumber: 241
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. When he finally came face to face with the leader of the gods, Lorand\u2019s
    strength is said to have surpassed even that of his youth. He sliced through
    the enemy\u2019s defenses, and cleaved a path for his comrades through their
    ranks. Ultimately, however, it wasn\u2019t enough, and Palmyna\u2019s forces
    were roundly obliterated. No one knows what happened to Lorand and his group."
  summonDesc: "Follow your heart\u2019s true path.<br>I shall light the way to your
    future<br>with my Inferno Blade!"
  fusionDesc: There are those who fear death,<br>and those who prepare for it.<br>Which
    are you?
  evoDesc: I remember this feeling well...<br>Finally, another chance to rain<br>down
    fire upon the gods of this land.
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
